Quest 362 "75Lv skill"
    Journal for karus "I've decided to undergo the test to learn the hidden skills of [Priest] Minerva."
    Journal for elmorad "I've decided to undergo the test to learn the hidden skills of [Priest] Minerva."
    Collect 10 of 810369000

Requires player level >= 75

Rewards none

On offer
    Say "Priests save the world in the name of the gods. You are qualified to undergo the final training of the priesthood."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "To train the lv.75 skill, you will need 10 [Spell Stone Powder]. Are you ready for this?"

On in_progress
    Say "To receive the lv.75 skill, you need 10 [Spell Stone Powder]."

On ready
    Say "Master, you have collected all items needed to be conferred the  Level 75 skill. Hurry back to [Priest] Minerva."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You now possess Fast Recovery, the Level 75 skill. I trust you will continue to work toward saving the world."
